<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p_05_cost_and_caching" name="05-cost-and-caching"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1280" pageHeight="1016" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="Model calls take about 15 s [calc] of an illustrative 20 s [I8] task and carry all its tokens; caching cuts a repeat vision call to about 35 % [calc]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1240" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a_h" value="A   WHERE ONE ILLUSTRATIVE TASK'S TIME GOES  (bar lengths to scale, 55 px per second)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="58" width="1220" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="6" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="segl0" value="receive, validate, lock 0.1 s [I1]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="100" width="200" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg1" value="orchestrator: route to vision&#10;2 s [I2]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="120" width="110" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tok1" value="1 call x 4 000 tok [I6]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="186" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg2" value="capture + resize&#10;2 s [I3]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="176" y="120" width="110" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg3" value="vision: find icon, tap&#10;5 s [I4]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="286" y="120" width="275" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tok3" value="1 call x 7 000 tok [I7]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="286" y="186" width="275" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg4" value="1 s&#10;[I5]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="561" y="120" width="55" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="segl4" value="settle" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="541" y="100" width="95" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg5" value="capture&#10;2 s [I3]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="616" y="120" width="110" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg6" value="vision: confirm, tap again if needed&#10;6 s [I4]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="726" y="120" width="330" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tok6" value="2 calls x 7 000 tok [I7]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="726" y="186" width="330" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seg7" value="orchestrator: FINISH&#10;2 s [I2]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="120" width="110" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tok7" value="1 call x 4 000 tok [I6]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="186" width="110" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tick0" value="0 s" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="214" width="40" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tickm0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="210" width="1" height="5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tick5" value="5 s" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="315" y="214" width="40" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tickm5" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="335" y="210" width="1" height="5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tick10" value="10 s" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="214" width="40" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tickm10" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="210" width="1" height="5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tick15" value="15 s" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="865" y="214" width="40" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tickm15" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="885" y="210" width="1" height="5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tick20" value="20 s" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="214" width="40" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="tickm20" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="210" width="1" height="5" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="a_sum" value="Model calls: 5 [I9] calls, 2 + 5 + 6 + 2 s = 15 s [calc]   |   device side: 0.1 + 2 + 1 + 2 s = 5.1 s [calc]   |   total 20.1 s [calc], about 20 s [I8]&#10;Input tokens: 4 000 + 7 000 + 2 x 7 000 + 4 000 = 29 000 [calc], about 30 000 [I10]   -&gt;  latency work starts with FEWER CALLS (e.g. the actuator's one OS call, diagram 02), not faster ones." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="232" width="1190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b_h" value="B   ONE VISION CALL IN BASE-INPUT-TOKEN UNITS  (bar lengths to scale)   split [I7]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="292" width="1220" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r1l" value="NO CACHING&#10;7 000 units" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="334" width="175" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="u0" value="stable prefix: tools + system&#10;3 000 tok" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="334" width="390" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="u1" value="earlier history&#10;2 500 tok" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="334" width="325" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="u2" value="new screenshot&#10;1 500 tok" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#e6e6e6;strokeColor=#888888;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="925" y="334" width="195" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bp0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="598" y="326" width="4" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bpl0" value="breakpoint 1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="550" y="308" width="100" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bp1" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#b85450;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="923" y="326" width="4" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="bpl1" value="breakpoint 2" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="875" y="308" width="100" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="spt" value="(one screenshot costs 1000-1800 input tokens [P21])" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=right;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="382" width="330" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r2l" value="CACHED&#10;2 425 units [calc]" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=right;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="420" width="175" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="420" width="39" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="249" y="420" width="32" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="new screenshot WRITTEN&#10;1 500 x 1.25 = 1 875" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="281" y="420" width="244" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c_read_l" value="first 5 500 tok READ from the cache:&#10;5 500 x 0.1 [P13] = 550 units" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#3d6b2a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="468" width="300" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c_w_l" value="write multiplier 1.25 [P11] (5 min lifetime)" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#9a6b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="468" width="300" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c_res" value="2 425 ÷ 7 000 = 35 % of the uncached call [calc]. The first call of a task pays the 1.25x write on the whole prefix; caching pays back from the second call on." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="416" width="695" height="54" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="C1  THE CACHING RULES (public docs)&#10;- The prefix order is fixed: tools -&gt; system -&gt; messages.&#10;- Up to 4 breakpoints [P14] per request: one after tools + system, the rest on the latest tool results, advanced each turn.&#10;- Lifetime 5 min [P15] by default, refreshed by each use; 1 h [P16] optional, written at 2x [P12].&#10;- Any change at or before a breakpoint misses everything after it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="512" width="400" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="C2  WHY PRUNING BREAKS CACHING, AND THE FIX&#10;Dropping the oldest screenshot edits an EARLY block, so every later block misses.&#10;Fix: prune in batches. Keep the last 3 [P17] screenshots and prune every 25 [P18] turns, so the prefix stays byte-identical between prunes.&#10;A 20 s [I8] task fits easily in the 5 min [P15] lifetime; long gaps between tasks let it expire." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="512" width="400" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="C3  MODEL TIERS PER ROLE&#10;One same-generation pair: fast tier $1, stronger tier $3 per million input tokens [P19]. Output price = 5x input [P20].&#10;Strong tier on the orchestrator only (a wrong route wastes a whole turn); fast tier on the many specialist calls.&#10;Outputs here are short tool calls, so input tokens dominate: caching matters more than reply length." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="512" width="400" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend:  green bar = model-call time  |  blue bar = device-side time  |  grey = uncached input tokens  |  light green = cache read  |  amber = cache write  |  red tick = cache breakpoint.  Units in B = tokens x price multiplier, i.e. cost relative to base input price." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=16;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="650" width="1220" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="sources" value="Sources. Numbers are loaded from ../constants.json by key (shown). P = public (cited doc/paper, value as published); I = illustrative (round value chosen to explain the idea, never a measurement); [calc] = my arithmetic on tagged values.&#10;Mechanism: notes/07-cost-and-latency.md (illustrative budget table, caching arithmetic, tiers). Public rules and multipliers: prompt-caching documentation (prefix order, breakpoints, lifetimes, price table read 2026-11 - prices change, multipliers are the durable part); computer-use tool documentation, 'Manage screenshot history'.&#10;[I1] receive_lock_latency_illustrative = 0.1 s. illustrative, 07 budget table&#10;[I2] orchestrator_call_latency_illustrative = 2 s. illustrative, 07 budget table&#10;[I3] capture_resize_latency_illustrative = 2 s. illustrative, 07 budget table&#10;[I4] vision_call_latency_illustrative = [5, 6] s per step. illustrative, 07 budget table&#10;[I5] settle_delay_illustrative = 1 s. illustrative wait after an action before the next screenshot&#10;[I6] orchestrator_call_tokens_illustrative = 4 000 input tokens. illustrative, 07 budget table&#10;[I7] vision_call_tokens_illustrative = {total: 7000, stable_prefix: 3000, history: 2500, new_screenshot: 1500} input tokens. illustrative split used in the 07 caching arithmetic; new_screenshot chosen inside cu_tokens_per_screenshot&#10;[I8] task_wall_time_illustrative = 20 s. illustrative end-to-end time for a simple 'open an app' task; sum of the 07 budget table&#10;[I9] task_model_calls_illustrative = 5 calls. illustrative: 2 orchestrator + 3 vision calls in the 07 budget table&#10;[I10] task_input_tokens_illustrative = 30 000 tokens. illustrative: 29 000 in the 07 budget table, rounded&#10;[P11] cache_write_5m_multiplier = 1.25 x base input price. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation, price table (5m writes column ÷ input column)&#10;[P12] cache_write_1h_multiplier = 2 x base input price. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation, TTL support&#10;[P13] cache_read_multiplier = 0.1 x base input price. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation, price table notes (standard multiplier)&#10;[P14] cache_max_breakpoints = 4 breakpoints per request. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation&#10;[P15] cache_ttl_default = 5 min. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation&#10;[P16] cache_ttl_long = 1 h. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation&#10;[P17] cu_screenshots_kept = 3 screenshots. public: Anthropic computer-use tool documentation, 'Manage screenshot history' (suggested default)&#10;[P18] cu_prune_interval = 25 turns. public: Anthropic computer-use tool documentation, 'Manage screenshot history' (suggested default)&#10;[P19] price_tier_pair_input = {fast: 1, strong: 3} USD per million input tokens. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation, price table (one same-generation fast/strong pair)&#10;[P20] price_output_to_input_ratio = 5 ratio. public: Anthropic prompt-caching documentation, price table (output ÷ input, every listed model)&#10;[P21] cu_tokens_per_screenshot = [1000, 1800] input tokens. public: Anthropic computer-use tool documentation, 'Manage screenshot history'" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="700" width="1220" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>